      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA substantial detached property extending to 368 sq. m. (3961 sq. ft.) approximately set on c. 0.39 acres, situated on the outskirts of Castletownbere, with a generous and versatile layout comprising eight bedrooms, all with ensuite facilities.\n\nThis impressive property offers extensive accommodation and would suit a variety of uses subject to any necessary planning requirements. The house appears to be a solid, well-constructed building, benefiting from concrete floors throughout and a BER rating of B. A particular feature is the professionally constructed external fire escape staircase to the rear, adding to the property's versatility.\n\nThe ground floor accommodation comprises two spacious reception rooms, a kitchen, utility room, store/study, two en-suite bedrooms and a separate shower room. \nThe first floor provides a further six bedrooms, all of which are ensuite offering a total of eight bedrooms within the main residence.\n\nThere is also a detached garage/studio laid out in a number of rooms, including bathroom facilities, providing useful additional space for workspace or other purposes. \n\nExternally, the property is approached via a generous driveway and is set on approximately 0.39 acres, providing ample parking and surrounding grounds.\n\nThe property is ideally situated on the outskirts of Castletownbere, offering a peaceful setting while remaining within easy reach of the town. The surrounding area is renowned for its spectacular coastal scenery with the town itself providing a good range of shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities. Cork City and Cork Airport are approximately 120 km away, with a typical driving time of around 1 hour 45 minutes. This makes the property an attractive option for those seeking the tranquility and spectacular scenery of the Beara Peninsula while retaining relatively convenient access to Cork City and the wider national and international transport network.\n\nFilane Lodge is a substantial and versatile property with excellent accommodation, a B-rated BER, generous grounds and significant potential for a purchaser seeking a large family home or a property capable of accommodating a range of alternative uses, subject to planning.\n\nServices: Mains water, septic tank, oil fired central heating and solid fuel fire.\n\nDisclaimer:\nWhilst every care has been taken in the preparation of these particulars, all information is provided in good faith and is believed to be correct, but is not guaranteed. Interested parties should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy and completeness of all details by independent inspection or enquiry. No representation or warranty is made regarding the condition, measurements, boundaries, planning status, services or other information relating to the property. All measurements, maps, photographs and distances are approximate and for guidance purposes only. Photographs, video and drone imagery are provided for illustrative purposes and may include features, furnishings or items not included in the sale."
      },
